      "message": "Related change and discussion:\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/obmc-ikvm/+/79772\n\nThis change follows the suggestion from reviewers to make the hub configurable,\nwhile keeping the existing default and automatic free-port selection.",
